=== distribution of rulings over the 128 SELF=1 bytes ===
  ADD_STATE                 56
  ADD_MATERIAL              32
  RAISE_BUDGET              12
  AUTHOR_SUCCESSOR           8
  RESHAPE                    8
  CHANGE_GRANULARITY         8
  SHIP                       2
  HARVEST_COUNTEREXAMPLE     2

=== distribution of rulings over the 128 SELF=0 bytes ===
  ADD_STATE                 57
  ADD_MATERIAL              32
  RAISE_BUDGET              11
  RESHAPE                    9
  CHANGE_GRANULARITY         8
  AUTHOR_SUCCESSOR           7
  SHIP                       2
  HARVEST_COUNTEREXAMPLE     2

=== bytes where setting SELF changes the ruling: 2 of 128 ===
  135  BUILT+AMB+UNREAD+SELF                         ADD_STATE -> RAISE_BUDGET
  136  NOTWIN+SELF                                   RESHAPE -> AUTHOR_SUCCESSOR

